{"4937970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Peppermint", "steam_appid": 4937970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937970/extras/b718e810086a5aa25bf44818abc771d3.avif?t=1785143339\" width=1280 height=435 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pepper Mint is a Candy Knight, loyal to her Candy Queen! Follow Pepper and her best friend Lemon Drop as they uncover a harrowing threat to their sweet, idyllic world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the guidance of a mysterious prince and collect pieces of sentient candy magic, which have possessed and morphed the innocent animals and people of the world into horrible candy monsters and amalgamations! It's up to you to help Pepper save her friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937970/extras/1f7ce9361bce6376b056e2b43d64e859.avif?t=1785143339\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937970/extras_big/1f7ce9361bce6376b056e2b43d64e859.webp?t=1785143339 width=1560 height=454 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sweet, yet macabre take on the metroidvania &amp; souls-like genre!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-detail, hand drawn pixel art with a combined cute, bright coloured and dark gritty visual aesthetic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937970/extras/784b59fe7f32057e7b3c3ed85827e2b2.poster.avif?t=1785143339\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937970/extras/784b59fe7f32057e7b3c3ed85827e2b2.webm?t=1785143339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937970/extras/784b59fe7f32057e7b3c3ed85827e2b2.mp4?t=1785143339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices &amp; exploration determine how the world and characters react and Pepper's abilities manifest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Responsive and high fidelity platforming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937970/extras/adfe6543d87ad00b37a25205f26a5aa0.poster.avif?t=1785143339\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937970/extras/adfe6543d87ad00b37a25205f26a5aa0.webm?t=1785143339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937970/extras/adfe6543d87ad00b37a25205f26a5aa0.mp4?t=1785143339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise<strong> </strong>your combat and gameplay  through a variety of equipment, collectibles and weapon choices!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique collection of bosses &amp; enemies to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937970/extras/ef4d10b79f823307a6e3478496fa3a4e.poster.avif?t=1785143339\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937970/extras/ef4d10b79f823307a6e3478496fa3a4e.webm?t=1785143339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937970/extras/ef4d10b79f823307a6e3478496fa3a4e.mp4?t=1785143339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937970/extras/b718e810086a5aa25bf44818abc771d3.avif?t=1785143339\" width=1280 height=435 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pepper Mint is a Candy Knight, loyal to her Candy Queen! Follow Pepper and her best friend Lemon Drop as they uncover a harrowing threat to their sweet, idyllic world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the guidance of a mysterious prince and collect pieces of sentient candy magic, which have possessed and morphed the innocent animals and people of the world into horrible candy monsters and amalgamations! It's up to you to help Pepper save her friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937970/extras/1f7ce9361bce6376b056e2b43d64e859.avif?t=1785143339\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937970/extras_big/1f7ce9361bce6376b056e2b43d64e859.webp?t=1785143339 width=1560 height=454 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sweet, yet macabre take on the metroidvania &amp; souls-like genre!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-detail, hand drawn pixel art with a combined cute, bright coloured and dark gritty visual aesthetic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937970/extras/784b59fe7f32057e7b3c3ed85827e2b2.poster.avif?t=1785143339\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937970/extras/784b59fe7f32057e7b3c3ed85827e2b2.webm?t=1785143339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937970/extras/784b59fe7f32057e7b3c3ed85827e2b2.mp4?t=1785143339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices &amp; exploration determine how the world and characters react and Pepper's abilities manifest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Responsive and high fidelity platforming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937970/extras/adfe6543d87ad00b37a25205f26a5aa0.poster.avif?t=1785143339\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937970/extras/adfe6543d87ad00b37a25205f26a5aa0.webm?t=1785143339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937970/extras/adfe6543d87ad00b37a25205f26a5aa0.mp4?t=1785143339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise<strong> </strong>your combat and gameplay  through a variety of equipment, collectibles and weapon choices!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique collection of bosses &amp; enemies to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937970/extras/ef4d10b79f823307a6e3478496fa3a4e.poster.avif?t=1785143339\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937970/extras/ef4d10b79f823307a6e3478496fa3a4e.webm?t=1785143339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937970/extras/ef4d10b79f823307a6e3478496fa3a4e.mp4?t=1785143339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Pepper finds that her home has been taken over by an encroaching, melted, pink candy, endangering herself, her friends and her Queen. Seek out the pieces of sentient candy magic and save Pepper and her friends!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937970/f9d46657f52719d761db51c4c8f747c35cd393bd/header.jpg?t=1785143339", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937970/705343c1d59168905826971e4803ceda6903b271/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785143339", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937970/705343c1d59168905826971e4803ceda6903b271/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785143339", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-3240, AMD FX-4300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  GeForce GTX 560 Ti (1GB), Radeon HD 7750 (1GB)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Cowboy Fish Games"], "publishers": ["Cowboy Fish Games"], "package_groups": [], "pl